         <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
            <ab xml:lang=" en">
               <pb n="" />
               <lb n="1" />The scribes of Horus of Edfou, of the gods Adelphoi (and) of the gods Euergetai <lb n="2" />are the ones who speak: [_] Register of the shares, <lb n="3" />which are accorded the wab priests of Horus of Edfou due to the writing below, <lb n="4" />of the temple of Edfou. <lb n="5" />Thotomous junior, son of Peteharsomtus, the lesonis of the 15th year: <lb n="6" />1½ (temple) years of the temple of Edfou. <lb n="7" />Peteharpochrates, son of Petamounis, the lesonis of the 10th year and the 20th year: <lb n="8" />⅓ of a (temple) year of the temple of Edfou. <lb n="9" />Berenebthis, (son of) Estphenis, the lesonis of the 2nd year <lb n="10" />(and) the 7th year; [_] The share of the priest of Hathor --?--, <lb n="11" />whose ⅓ of one year have been awarded(?) to Hathor of Edfou. <lb n="12" />Peteharpochrates, son of Thotomous, the lesonis of the 22nd year: <lb n="13" />The half of one (temple) year [of the temple of Edfou]. <lb n="14"
                   />Thotomous senior, son of Harsiesis, the lesonis of the 18th year: <lb n="15" />He has no income. <lb n="16" />Issued in the 24th regnal year, [///] of Phaophi. <lb n="17" />Issued by Psenchnoumis, son of [///]. <lb n="18" />Countersigned by Parates, son of Esminis. </ab>
         </div>
